      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. The nominated communities of Harlem and the South Bronx shall be made full partners in the strategic planning process for the application for Empowerment Zone status, and New York City's officials, coordinated by the Executive Director of the Economic Policy and Marketing Group under the direction of the Deputy Mayor for Finance and Economic Development, will act appropriately to insure that this condition is met.",
